From 4a93005dbb66ce91d804bce0001221114dd01a54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Skynizz <182822215+Skynizz@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 14:28:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] KRC: exact relighting by lamp groups, relit NRD history, library
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Libraries/Krc/include: KrcRelight.h (GPU, as an extension of SHaRC) and KrcRelightHost.h (CPU,
  "after / before" ratio of each lamp group); the sample uses them.
- Group shares tracked along SHaRC's paths, krcRelight pass before the update.
- NRD: history confidence (mode 1) or input normalised by the smoothed product S (mode 2,
  relit history); anti-firefly toggle; history clearing on demand.
- Bench: lampadd, lamp, lampgroup, lights, relight, nrdconf, nrdaf, nrdreset; targetLight = -1
  as soon as a lamp is added (the sample only sampled lamp 0).
- Cost: the per-entry passes only clean the table at eviction (KRC-L +0.05 ms at
  most, KRC-A +0.24 ms).

